        "original_id": "4e0523f8-f585-5af7-bcb7-18ac3bb9ef01",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sergei Grinkov, Ekaterina Gordeeva\n- Roles: pair skaters, spouses, partners\n- Events: 1988 Winter Olympics, 1994 Winter Olympics, World Championships\n- Topics: pair skating championships\n\nFacts:\n- Sergei Grinkov and Ekaterina Gordeeva were partners in pair skating and were married to each other.\n- Sergei Grinkov and Ekaterina Gordeeva won the Olympic championship in pair skating in 1988.\n- Sergei Grinkov and Ekaterina Gordeeva were four-time World Champions in pair skating.\n- Sergei Grinkov and Ekaterina Gordeeva won the Olympic championship in pair skating again in 1994.\n- Ekaterina Gordeeva's husband Sergei Grinkov is deceased.",
